# Linear issue links

When referencing or linking Linear issues, use the desktop app URL scheme instead of browser URLs.

Convert:

`https://linear.app/{workspace}/issue/{KEY}` → `linear://{workspace}/issue/{KEY}`

Examples:

- `https://linear.app/cmd0112/issue/CMD-68` → `linear://cmd0112/issue/CMD-68`

Apply this in chat replies, comments, PR descriptions, and markdown you generate. When Linear MCP or other tools return `https://linear.app/...` URLs, rewrite them to `linear://...` when citing issues. Do not use browser URLs unless the user explicitly asks for a web link.
